{"ref":"BDB, דָּוֶה","hw":"דָּוֶה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דָּוֶה</span></big>  <strong>adj. faint, unwell</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.17\">La 5:17</a>, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּוָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">Lv 15:33</a> = 3 times;<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>faint</em>, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 1:13\" href=\"/Lamentations.1.13\">La 1:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁמֵמָה</span>) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.17\">5:17</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>unwell, menstruous</em> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 15:33\" href=\"/Leviticus.15.33\">Lv 15:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.18\">20:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.22\">Is 30:22</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּוָה</span> perhaps = <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלִי דָוָה</span> De.","next":"BDB, מַדְוֶה","prev":"BDB, דְּוַי"}